  "description": "Provides integration between IT Hit User File System Engine and Windows Explorer, enabling seamless user experience for virtual file systems in Windows. \nSupports features such as file status icons, context menu integration, and advanced synchronization status reporting. \nDesigned for .NET Standard 2.0, this library leverages the Windows Cloud Files API to deliver OneDrive-like on-demand loading, offline file support, and deep Explorer integration for custom virtual file systems.",
